   "text": "Start the Arduino software and go to preferences page under 'File' menu, on Windows, or under 'Arduino' menu  on Mac. Click the small button next to the 'Board Manager URLs' field and type in the address: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MakeLab-Team/ArduLab/main/package_makelab_index.json\nThen, click 'OK' button  on both windows",
   "title": "",
   "addToBackground": false,
   "muted": false,
   "autoPlay": false,
   "isGalleryStep": false,
   "isDominantText": false,
   "type": 1,
