   "text": "Open the Ardublock editor by clicking on Tools -> ArduBlock | Enhanced by Forreal Team. This is the editor we will use to write code with, by dragging and connecting blocks located in the Drawers to the left onto the main work area. In any case you are not sure where a certain block came from, look for the drawer with the same color as the block. This will get you in the right place about 95% of the time...",
